e":"comments","type":"comments","url":"","style":null,"length":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama","Drama","Romance","Law"],"id":18425,"type":"SERIES","title":"Money Flower","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk58/seasons/d11508bf-7194-431a-8250-6665bff6714a.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk48/seasons/531d1750-002d-4d3d-8845-b4c71f706b77.jpg","likes":44,"dislikes":1,"views":6108,"release_date":"1510358400000","season_number":1,"description":"Managing director Kang Pil Joo is envied by many inside the Chungah Group where he is known for his intelligence and high-performance. He keeps his real identity a secret from the Chungah Group founding family and serves them as an obedient servant but he is actually grooming them for his scheme. His plan was to make Mo Hyun fall in love with him for his revenge, but he finds himself falling desperately in love with her free-spirited personality. The “Money Flower” portrays a story of interlinked relationships between Pil Joo who is capable of bringing down Chungah, Mo Hyun who seeks love and a young Chungah Group scion named Bu Cheon. And these characters all come to the fore as money dictates their lives in a web of desire, greed, and love.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.5}],"value":8.5,"age":"R"},"current_season_id":6718,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}